  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="SV">Aktiviteten saknar beskrivning. Kontakta Sida f&#xF6;r mer information. Ring +46 8 698 50 00 eller skicka e-post till sida@sida.se.</narrative>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Safina Sweden through Safina Trust Fund Tanzania is working with the youth to raise awareness, involve the youth in HIV/AIDS prevention and behavioural change. The progranme is based in Mwanza, works through a network of organisations and covers two regions of Mwanza and Kagera. The project is entitled Safina Action against Aids Network (Safina AAA - Network) The programme runs from 2004-2007.</narrative>
